Adapt the GSO context conversion from Linux v5.7, including the
source/destination register alias fix in the shared-info pointer lookup.
Keep unsupported timestamp and wire-length fields inaccessible.

Upstream: cf62089b0edd7e74a1f474844b4d9f7b5697fb5c
Fix prerequisite: 06a22d897d82f12776d44dbf0850f5895469cb2a

